sequenceDiagram
%% Dual Logging Sequence Diagram
%% Shows one measurement cycle with both offline (SD) and online (Cloud) paths
    autonumber
    participant MIC as 🎙️ INMP441<br/>(I2S)
    participant SENS as 🌡️ DHT22/GPS
    participant ESP as ⚙️ ESP32<br/>(FreeRTOS)
    participant SD as 💾 SD Card<br/>(CSV)
    participant WIFI as 📡 Wi-Fi
    participant INFLUX as ☁️ InfluxDB<br/>(AWS EC2)
    participant WEB as 🌐 3D Web App

    Note over MIC,ESP: Audio path runs at 16 kHz continuously
    MIC->>ESP: I2S DMA block (BUFFER_LEN = 512 samples)
    activate ESP
    ESP->>ESP: micTask: enqueue AudioBlock
    ESP->>ESP: sdProcessTask: dequeue → compute RMS<br/>→ EMA smooth → currentSPL (dB)
    deactivate ESP

    Note over SENS,ESP: Sensor tasks run on their own intervals
    SENS-->>ESP: DHT22 (2 s), GPS NMEA (1 Hz)
    activate ESP
    ESP->>ESP: Update sensor globals<br/>(mutex-protected)
    deactivate ESP

    rect rgba(220, 252, 231, 0.5)
        Note over ESP,SD: 📂 Offline path (every 1 s) — Always runs
        ESP->>ESP: getDateTimeStr() ← DS3231 RTC
        ESP->>SD: write CSV row<br/>timestamp, spl, temp, humi, lat, lng, ...
        SD-->>ESP: ✅ OK / ❌ SD error
        alt SD error ≥ threshold
            ESP->>ESP: sdHealthy = false<br/>stop recording
        end
    end

    rect rgba(252, 231, 243, 0.5)
        Note over ESP,INFLUX: ☁️ Online path (every 1 s, batch 5)
        ESP->>ESP: readXxxSafe() — collect snapshot
        ESP->>ESP: Build Line Protocol payload
        ESP->>WIFI: ensureWiFiConnected()<br/>(wifiMutex)
        WIFI-->>ESP: connected / reconnecting

        alt Wi-Fi connected
            ESP->>+INFLUX: POST /api/v2/write<br/>Authorization: Token ...
            INFLUX-->>-ESP: HTTP 204 / 5xx
            alt success
                ESP->>ESP: backoff.reset()
            else fail
                ESP->>ESP: backoff.nextMs()<br/>(1.5 s × 2 → 60 s cap)
            end
        else Wi-Fi down
            ESP->>ESP: skip — retry next cycle<br/><b>(data still in SD)</b>
        end
    end

    Note over INFLUX,WEB: Visualization layer (independent of device)
    WEB->>INFLUX: Flux query<br/>last 15 min, by geo
    INFLUX-->>WEB: Time-series JSON
    WEB->>WEB: Render markers + heatmap<br/>+ Sun-Path + Water Level
